{
  "id": 96886563,
  "iid": 2797,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "80211: Rename VHT_TX_PWR_ENVELOPE to TX_PWR_ENVELOPE",
  "description": "The Transmit Power Envelope is now present in 5G and 6G bands across both VHT and HE PHYs. The IEEE has dropped `VHT` from the IE name, and VHT operation is not allowed in 6G; seeing a VHT named IE in 6 GHz is confusing. This PR is to remove 'VHT' from the displayed tag name to 1) align with the IEEE standard and 2) add clarity that it is no longer PHY specific.\n\nSources:\n\n- 802.11-2020; Table 9-92 shows as \"Transmit Power Envelope\"; 9.4.2.161 shows as \"Transmit Power Envelope element\"\n\n- 802.11ax-2021 (D8.0); 9.4.2.161 show as \"Transmit Power Envelope element\"",
  "state": "merged",
